// How Vibe With Me's clock worker gets deployed from a clone of this repo.
//
// Like the Academy's, this is not a build step and the game does not need
// it to open: with the worker down, each device keeps time by its own
// clock and plays on its own, and says so. It is only a note of where
// worker.js goes, so that `npx wrangler deploy` in this folder is the
// whole of a release.
//
// There is nothing bound to it and nothing secret to set. The one thing
// it needs is a signed-in wrangler (`npx wrangler login`, once per
// machine), and it ends up at https://clock.campbell226.workers.dev/.
{
  "name": "clock",
  "main": "worker.js",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-10-12"
}
